 177:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *  disabled in order to change the SSS mode bit. If the clock is enabled when
 178:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *  SetDividerRegister is called, then the source clock must be running.
