 182:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *    divider; the clock hardware divides by clkDivider plus one. For example,
 183:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *    to divide the clock by 2, this parameter should be set to 1.
 184:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *  restart:  If nonzero, restarts the clock divider: the current clock cycle
 185:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *   will be truncated and the new divide value will take effect immediately. If
 186:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *   zero, the new divide value will take effect at the end of the current clock
 187:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *   cycle.
