 307:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** * Summary:
 308:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *  Sets flags that control the operating mode of the clock. This function only
 309:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *  changes flags from 0 to 1; flags that are already 1 will remain unchanged.
 310:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *  To clear flags, use the ClearModeRegister function. The clock must be
 311:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *  disabled before changing the mode.
