 313:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** * Parameters:
 314:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *  clkMode: Bit mask containing the bits to set. For PSoC 3 and PSoC 5,
 315:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *   clkMode should be a set of the following optional bits or'ed together.
 316:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *   - CYCLK_EARLY Enable early phase mode. Rising edge of output clock will
 317:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *                 occur when the divider count reaches half of the divide
 318:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *                 value.
 319:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *   - CYCLK_DUTY  Enable 50% duty cycle output. When enabled, the output clock
