 321:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *                 disabled, the output clock is asserted for one period of the
 322:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *                 source clock.
 323:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *   - CYCLK_SYNC  Enable output synchronization to master clock. This should
 324:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *                 be enabled for all synchronous clocks.
 325:Generated_Source\PSoC5/PC_IntClock.c **** *   See the Technical Reference Manual for details about setting the mode of
